msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:288
#: 561db2f1d81744cca399e8be55b5ecf7
msgid "The PPM/SBus.in pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:290
#: 348532470d0245f485eadf4b1eb0e56d
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL4 (UART8) would need to be used for receiver connections. Below are setups using UART4. :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:292
#: f5d975e5da5c41e9983aa54b2c8d130b
msgid "FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"15\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:294
#: 2fa4560f1535484ba4c6e07731b783cf
msgid "CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:296
#: 61d8b8730b6141cca33b764a4f07bf1c
msgid "SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" and connects only the UART4 TX pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:298
#: 54c4dd881ee747eea83d857481d294e1
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

